Description: ProjT Launcher — cross-platform Minecraft launcher
 ProjT Launcher is a fork of Prism Launcher, providing a modern,
 cross-platform Minecraft launcher with advanced instance management,
 mod handling, multiple loader support and a polished Qt-based user
 interface.
 .
 This package contains the main launcher executable and desktop
 integration files.

Package: projt-launcher-data
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Data files for ProjT Launcher
 This package contains architecture-independent data files for
 ProjT Launcher such as icons, translations and static resources.
